---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Peter Yates">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-8" style="color: var(--color-text);">About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm a software engineer based in the UK. I work on distributed systems, developer tools,
      and anything that involves making computers do interesting things reliably.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is where I think out loud. Posts range from technical deep-dives to shorter
      notes on things I've learned or found useful.
    </p>
    <h2>Work</h2>
    <p>
      I've spent most of my career building backend systems — databases, APIs, infrastructure,
      the kinds of things that work best when nobody notices them.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      The best way to reach me is by email at
      <a href="mailto:peter.yates5@icloud.com">peter.yates5@icloud.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
